# Mechanozoa {4}{U}{U} 5/5: "When this creature enters, tap target artifact or creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it." Bot1 pays with its
# Island and five Moxen on turn 3. Its own Mox Pearl (an artifact it controls) and Bot2's Island (a land) are refused as targets; Bot2's Mox Jet, an artifact that
# is not a creature, is accepted: it is tapped and gets a stun counter, while Bot2's Ornithopter (an artifact creature) is left alone. On turn 4 Bot2's untap
# step removes the counter instead of untapping the Mox.

